| id | name    | department | salary |
+----+---------+------------+--------+
|  1 | Shreya  | IT         |  55000 |
|  2 | Rahul   | Finance    |  45000 |
|  3 | Rishabh | HR         |  48000 |
|  5 | Shristi | IT         |  60000 |
|  6 | Kriti   | Finance    |  35000 |
